"{\"tasks\":[\"{\\\"family\\\":\\\"lines\\\",\\\"statement\\\":\\\"Write a short text about how a spider builds its web.\\\\n\\\\nRules:\\\\n1. The text has exactly 6 lines.\\\\n2. Read from top to bottom, the first letters of the lines spell \\\\\\\"ASTCSB\\\\\\\".\\\\n3. Line 3 has exactly 9 words.\\\\n4. Line 3 does not contain the letter \\\\\\\"i\\\\\\\", in either case.\\\\n5. The last word of the text is \\\\\\\"fly\\\\\\\".\\\\n\\\\nDefinitions: a line is a non-empty line of text; empty lines do not count. A word is a run of the letters A-Z and a-z, with apostrophes allowed inside it; digits, hyphens and all other characters separate words. The first letter of a line is the first letter A-Z or a-z on it.\\\",\\\"topic\\\":\\\"how a spider builds its web\\\",\\\"rules\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"line_count\\\",\\\"n\\\":6},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"acrostic\\\",\\\"letters\\\":\\\"ASTCSB\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"words_in_line\\\",\\\"line\\\":3,\\\"n\\\":9},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"no_letter\\\",\\\"line\\\":3,\\\"letter\\\":\\\"i\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"last_word\\\",\\\"word\\\":\\\"fly\\\"}],\\\"salt\\\":\\\"2db019db7403c6dae6e77129d73720bdec22eaf168406650befa16954d148221\\\"}\",\"{\\\"family\\\":\\\"seating\\\",\\\"statement\\\":\\\"At the cinema, six friends took a single row of seats. Celia and Rosa sat next to each other, and Rosa was somewhere to the left of Celia. Hugo sat between Celia and Xena, while Hugo and Xena were also neighbours. Iris and Fern sat next to each other, and Iris was somewhere to the left of Xena. Fern sat between Hugo and Iris, and Fern also sat between Rosa and Xena.\\\",\\\"people\\\":[\\\"Hugo\\\",\\\"Iris\\\",\\\"Xena\\\",\\\"Rosa\\\",\\\"Celia\\\",\\\"Fern\\\"],\\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"adjacent\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Celia\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Rosa\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Hugo\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Celia\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Xena\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"adjacent\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Iris\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Fern\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"left_of\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Rosa\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Celia\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"left_of\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Iris\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Xena\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Fern\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Hugo\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Iris\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Fern\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Rosa\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Xena\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"adjacent\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Hugo\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Xena\\\"}],\\\"salt\\\":\\\"fdc9cad4acb9fd0b0acf7c7af52a54fdf25786c11edde48070c7e4baca75ec3d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"family\\\":\\\"seating\\\",\\\"statement\\\":\\\"On a bus trip, seven passengers filled one row of seats. Vik sat between Faye and Uma, and Vik was somewhere to the left of Uma. Zane sat between Nora and Kira, and Nora sat between Kira and Uma. Zane and Nora were not neighbours. Sami sat between Vik and Kira, and Vik and Sami were neighbours. Faye sat at one of the two ends of the row.\\\",\\\"people\\\":[\\\"Faye\\\",\\\"Sami\\\",\\\"Zane\\\",\\\"Kira\\\",\\\"Nora\\\",\\\"Vik\\\",\\\"Uma\\\"],\\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Vik\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Faye\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Uma\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Zane\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Nora\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Kira\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Nora\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Kira\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Uma\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"left_of\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Vik\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Uma\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"not_adjacent\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Zane\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Nora\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Sami\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Vik\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Kira\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"adjacent\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Vik\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Sami\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"at_end\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Faye\\\"}],\\\"salt\\\":\\\"c81bde21afb7bbdcb83c439e4a9a0af650c51514d617c9b7f9c7dc3e799e606c\\\"}\",\"{\\\"family\\\":\\\"seating\\\",\\\"statement\\\":\\\"At a dinner party, six guests were seated in one row. Quin was somewhere to the left of Uma, and Uma was somewhere to the left of Elsa. Zora sat between Quin and Uma. Hugo and Uma sat next to each other. Uma was somewhere to the left of Omar, and Omar sat at one of the two ends. Uma also sat between Quin and Hugo.\\\",\\\"people\\\":[\\\"Hugo\\\",\\\"Quin\\\",\\\"Uma\\\",\\\"Elsa\\\",\\\"Omar\\\",\\\"Zora\\\"],\\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"left_of\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Quin\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Uma\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"left_of\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Uma\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Elsa\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Zora\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Quin\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Uma\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"adjacent\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Hugo\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Uma\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"left_of\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Uma\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Omar\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"at_end\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Omar\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Uma\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Quin\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Hugo\\\"}],\\\"salt\\\":\\\"9cff958b4895430feded9c32f56491377cd5f15a898e2f70cbb20a9f1ee56434\\\"}\",\"{\\\"family\\\":\\\"seating\\\",\\\"statement\\\":\\\"In a photo session, seven people lined up in one row of chairs. Wade sat between Cyrus and Kira. Bea sat between Cyrus and Liam. Nora sat between Bea and Boris, and Boris was somewhere to the left of Bea. Cyrus sat between Boris and Nora. Boris sat between Kira and Wade.\\\",\\\"people\\\":[\\\"Liam\\\",\\\"Wade\\\",\\\"Bea\\\",\\\"Boris\\\",\\\"Nora\\\",\\\"Cyrus\\\",\\\"Kira\\\"],\\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Wade\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Cyrus\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Kira\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Bea\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Cyrus\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Liam\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Nora\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Bea\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Boris\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"left_of\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Boris\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Bea\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Cyrus\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Boris\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Nora\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"between\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Boris\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"Kira\\\",\\\"c\\\":\\\"Wade\\\"}],\\\"salt\\\